    - target: {fileID: 8092239633180993904, guid: d91cff9c5e015414ab487518c41fbb00, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Things... are very strange. Like, VERY. I feel watched 24/7. As if
        those nosy neighbors were keeping an eye on my wife.


        I haven''t
        done anything wrong, and neither has my wife; I''m just taking care of her
        and minding my own business.


        What do these                  want
        so badly?


        It doesn''t matter. They won''t mess with our peace.


'
